  "title": "DRDGOLD EXPECTS EARNINGS PER SHARE TO RISE UP TO BETWEEN 85% AND 95% AS PRODUCTION BEATS GUIDANCE",
  "summary": "Johannesburg, South Africa. 13 August 2026. DRDGOLD Limited (JSE: DRD, A2X: DRD, NYSE: DRD) expects earnings and headline earnings per share to increase by between 85% and 95% for the year ended 30 June 2026, with production exceeding annual guidance and cash operating costs coming in below guidance.",
